{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A NON-STOP MUSIC DRIVEN ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strap on your skis and grab your sword in the non-stop music-driven adventure of Fresh Tracks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202950/extras/FT_Level_Selection.gif?t=1740495846\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Skaii, you must unite the splintered pantheon of Norwyn to defeat Mar, the Queen of Terror, and restore hope to the land. Fight, jump, and dodge increasing obstacles and menacing minions as you delve deeper into the darkness that has befallen the land of Norwyn.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202950/extras/Ekkos-enemies.gif?t=1740495846\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you conquer each new trail, you will unlock new abilities, new divine companions, and new tracks of pulse-pounding original music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rhythm-Driven Gameplay:</strong> Movement, combat, and progression seamlessly sync with a dynamic, evolving soundtrack.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story-Rich Roguelite Elements:</strong> Every playthrough unravels new narrative layers as the Mythics reveal the legends of Norwyn through story and song.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Replayability:</strong> Roguelite mechanics encourage skiers to refine their skills while unlocking upgrades and strategies for future runs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Deeply Immersive Soundtrack:</strong> Get in the flow with <i><strong>Fresh Tracks\u2019</strong></i> rich, genre-crossing soundtrack that surprises with each new track and dynamically responds to your every movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE WORLD WILL SING YOUR SONG!</strong> <br> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3202950?t=1740495846","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202950/64c79be6b900f5c4bb5b6668273fa501cac98069/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740495846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202950/07892c7fa924f8515b2e1c007d2340c2ff397708/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740495846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202950/07892c7fa924f8515b2e1c007d2340c2ff397708/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740495846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A NON-STOP MUSIC DRIVEN ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strap on your skis and grab your sword in the non-stop music-driven adventure of Fresh Tracks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202950/extras/FT_Level_Selection.gif?t=1740495846\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Skaii, you must unite the splintered pantheon of Norwyn to defeat Mar, the Queen of Terror, and restore hope to the land. Fight, jump, and dodge increasing obstacles and menacing minions as you delve deeper into the darkness that has befallen the land of Norwyn.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202950/extras/Ekkos-enemies.gif?t=1740495846\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you conquer each new trail, you will unlock new abilities, new divine companions, and new tracks of pulse-pounding original music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rhythm-Driven Gameplay:</strong> Movement, combat, and progression seamlessly sync with a dynamic, evolving soundtrack.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story-Rich Roguelite Elements:</strong> Every playthrough unravels new narrative layers as the Mythics reveal the legends of Norwyn through story and song.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High Replayability:</strong> Roguelite mechanics encourage skiers to refine their skills while unlocking upgrades and strategies for future runs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Deeply Immersive Soundtrack:</strong> Get in the flow with <i><strong>Fresh Tracks\u2019</strong></i> rich, genre-crossing soundtrack that surprises with each new track and dynamically responds to your every movement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE WORLD WILL SING YOUR SONG!</strong> <br> </h2>","developers":["Buffalo Buffalo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202950/header.jpg?t=1740495846","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098360,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098360/movie480.mp4?t=1740494043","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098360/movie_max.mp4?t=1740494043"},"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098360/3e30740a59bf30726605fea466ec0b868c8bed17/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740494043","